('notable_npc', 'king-arrthuu', 'Caliber X vibro-blade', '2D4 M.D.', 1, NULL, 'As a plain short sword vibro-blade; the spiked handle does 1D4 M.D. Thrown and guided telekinetically at +5 to strike, 150 ft (as printed, 46.7 m), returning for one melee action; one I.S.P. a toss.', 2),
